              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Additional Incendiaries Injection" id="be7d-53d9-095d-81a8" hidden="false">
              <description>Once per game, when this Admiral activates a unit with the Colossus trait, they can attempt to enact a Special Valour Effect. 


If successful, the Torrent (X ) value of all weapons in the unit is doubled for the duration of the Activation.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
