                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Gyroscopic Rocket Stabilisers" id="7934-a156-6660-fe5e" hidden="false">
              <description>Once per game, when they Activate an Airborne unit, this Admiral can discard a Victory &amp; Valour Card from their hand. 


They cannot do so if any models in the unit have a System Failure Critical Damage Effect. If they do so, the unit gains the Lateral Engines (6”) system for the duration of its Activation.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
