            <rule name="Hellion Algol Constructs" id="23b2-ef8f-7cfa-7686" hidden="false">
              <description>Once per Round, when a unit from this Force makes a Boarding action, the Admiral can discard a Victory &amp; Valour Card from their hand before making the Action Roll.


If they do so, they can re-roll any Blank results in the Action Roll, and the target gains an additional level of Disorder after the Action has been Resolved.</description>
